 zig/src/core/lanes/open.zig            |  6 +-
 zig/src/core/lanes/open_trace_test.zig | 86 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 91 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 zig/src/core/lanes/open_trace_test.zig

